  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        77.7385032496977,
        88.17561711192563,
        109.04984483638151,
        97.18212803851112
      ],
      "text": "Test 3\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.37860277168984,
        124.88546586872734,
        174.19184600019207,
        135.69327312287473
      ],
      "text": "Questions 37-40\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.37860277168984,
        152.9577031533404,
        279.2107791229872,
        163.7655104074878
      ],
      "text": "Choose the correct letter, A, B,\nC or D.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.7385032496977,
        180.31013948193774,
        395.58106060270245,
        192.19873185481626
      ],
      "text": "Write the correct letter in boxes 37-40 on your answer sheet.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.01870229368198,
        207.6625758105351,
        470.7965701205843,
        219.5511681834136
      ],
      "text": "37\nWhat method did Jamie Tehrani use to test his ideas about fairy tales?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        102.21173575423217,
        229.61650496901453,
        507.38768217997034,
        283.973719856519
      ],
      "text": "A\nHecompared oral and written forms of the same stories.\nB\nHe looked at many different forms of the same basic story.\nC\nHe looked at unrelated stories from many different countries.\nD\n Hecontrasted the development of fairy tales with that of living creatures.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.37860277168984,
        299.79709818054715,
        412.949831897239,
        312.0459571411321
      ],
      "text": "38\nWhen discussing Tehrani’s views, Jack Zipes suggests that\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        102.93153671024788,
        321.39112686101873,
        440.66222728139593,
        346.9555712884975
      ],
      "text": "A\nTehrani ignores key changes in the role of women.\nB\nstories which are too horrific are not always taken seriously.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        103.29143718825574,
        349.46336414563183,
        470.6779212894963,
        375.7483417485232
      ],
      "text": "C_\nTehrani overemphasises the importance of violence in stories.\nD\nfeatures of stories only survive if they have a deeper significance.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.7385032496977,
        391.21181959454356,
        423.77560781538847,
        404.18118244176526
      ],
      "text": "39\nWhy does Tehrani refer to Chinese and Japanese fairy tales?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        103.29143718825574,
        413.8855497090387,
        387.0297924418067,
        467.16233094312264
      ],
      "text": "A\nto indicate that Jack Zipes’ theory is incorrect\nB\nto suggest that crime is a global problem\nC\nto imply that all fairy tales have a similar meaning\nD_\nto add more evidence for Jack Zipes’ ideas\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        77.7385032496977,
        483.3463419645556,
        379.1335384646811,
        494.8746970385037
      ],
      "text": "40\nWhat does Mathias Clasen believe about fairy tales?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
